Problem 2 — Users With Many Searches

Platform: StrataScratch
Concept: Subquery in FROM with GROUP BY + HAVING
Task: Count how many users made more than 5 searches during August 2021.
Logic: The inner query filters to August 2021, groups by user, and keeps only users with more than 5 searches. The outer query counts those users.


SELECT COUNT(user_id) AS high_search_user
FROM (
SELECT user_id
FROM fb_searches
WHERE date >= '2021-08-01'
AND date <= '2021-08-31'
GROUP BY user_id
HAVING COUNT(search_id) > 5
) AS subquery;
